      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Leechburg’s public library offers genealogy archives and local history books, a treasure trove for family researchers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://museumsdatabase.com/museums/view/27475",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Market Street’s brick storefronts look like sentinels of small‑town charm, where rush hour means only three cars at the stop sign.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://familydestinationsguide.com/gorgeous-town-pennsylvania-locals/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Although the canal vanished, the pioneering spirit it sparked still fuels Leechburg’s resilient character today.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
